  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This component implements the Time-based One-Time Password (TOTP) generation and verification logic according to RFC 6238. It serves as a critical security utility layer, managing secret keys via file I/O for high-privilege agent action approval. Core functionality relies on HMAC-SHA1 hashing against a time counter, incorporating a window check to mitigate clock drift and prevent replay attacks."
